patch_requests.patch:
Compose with your BotPetAreaGuard Felstorm gate. Add the include next to the other Bots includes:
#include "Bots/Content/Raids/BlackwingDescent/Encounters/Magmaw/BotMagmawPreEncounterGuardUnits.h"
and extend the Felstorm condition:
                    if (pet->GetSpellHistory()->IsReady(felstorm)
                        && !BotPetAreaGuard::PetAreaSpellReachesProtectedTarget(bot, pet, felstorm)
                        && !BotEncounter::MagmawPreEncounterGuard::EvaluateUnitArea(pet, target, felstorm).Forbidden())
                        pet->CastSpell(pet, FelstormSpellId, false);
EvaluateUnitArea measures from the pet and from its target (the pet follows its target while it whirls). It uses the triggered whirl radius, each part's runtime combat reach and a 5-yard chase margin, and it is inert once Magmaw is engaged or when no living Magmaw part is within 80 yards (so it has no effect outside BWD). The legacy b5 roster has no Felguard, so the change is inert there.
